Third-party documents in tests/corpus/vendor
============================================

vendor/verapdf/
    A small selection from the veraPDF corpus (https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-corpus),
    licensed by the veraPDF Consortium under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
    International licence (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

    The files are used unmodified as conformance fixtures and renamed for legibility;
    tests/corpus/vendor.json records the original path of each one.

    The Isartor test suite, also present in that repository, is deliberately excluded:
    it arrived there under different terms.

Everything else under tests/corpus is generated from our own sources and is covered by
the repository's MIT licence.
